    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acrogorpon</strong> is a retro-styled 3D multiplayer FPS game, offering a unique blend of acrobatics, intense gore, and a diverse arsenal of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 Damage and Limb Separation Zones:</strong> Experience unparalleled realism with advanced damage modeling and precise limb separation mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Text:</strong> Personalize your in-game interface with fully customizable text options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bindable Configuration System:</strong> Enjoy flexible control schemes with a comprehensive bindable configuration system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Voting Options:</strong> Engage the community with a wide array of in-game voting options for enhanced player involvement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game Admin Commands:</strong> Utilize powerful admin commands for seamless game management and moderation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Customization:</strong> Tailor your gaming experience with extensive customization options to match your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Widescreen and Non-Widescreen Support (16:9, 4:3):</strong> Experience the game in both widescreen and standard screen formats for versatile display support.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acrogorpon</strong> is a retro-styled 3D multiplayer FPS game, offering a unique blend of acrobatics, intense gore, and a diverse arsenal of weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Current Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 Damage and Limb Separation Zones:</strong> Experience unparalleled realism with advanced damage modeling and precise limb separation mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Text:</strong> Personalize your in-game interface with fully customizable text options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bindable Configuration System:</strong> Enjoy flexible control schemes with a comprehensive bindable configuration system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive Voting Options:</strong> Engage the community with a wide array of in-game voting options for enhanced player involvement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-game Admin Commands:</strong> Utilize powerful admin commands for seamless game management and moderation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Customization:</strong> Tailor your gaming experience with extensive customization options to match your style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Widescreen and Non-Widescreen Support (16:9, 4:3):</strong> Experience the game in both widescreen and standard screen formats for versatile display support.</p></li></ul>",
